From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sunu Aziz Rahayu <sunuazizrahayu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] magisk: define __BIONIC_ALIGN if missing

Makro itu sudah dihapus dari header bionic Android 16, sehingga
kompilasi resetprop_phh gagal:

  prop_area.cpp:150:26: error: use of undeclared identifier
  '__BIONIC_ALIGN'

Definisikan lokal sebagai fallback. (Port dari MisterZtr/
cawilliamson.)
---
 Magisk/native/jni/systemproperties/prop_area.cpp | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Magisk/native/jni/systemproperties/prop_area.cpp b/Magisk/native/jni/systemproperties/prop_area.cpp
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/Magisk/native/jni/systemproperties/prop_area.cpp
+++ b/Magisk/native/jni/systemproperties/prop_area.cpp
@@ -37,6 +37,10 @@

 #include <new>

+#ifndef __BIONIC_ALIGN
+#define __BIONIC_ALIGN(__value, __alignment) (((__value) + (__alignment) - 1) & ~((__alignment) - 1))
+#endif
+
 #include <async_safe/log.h>

 #include "system_properties/prop_area.h"
--
2.54.0
